{"id":"48e633f21fe5ce4dfb99a377ece40d77609c881f","axis":"silent","repo":"argoproj/argo-workflows","sha":"48e633f21fe5ce4dfb99a377ece40d77609c881f","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"AGENTS.md","lines":["@@ -38,7 +38,7 @@ Cross-cutting invariants: the executor never writes the Workflow object — outp"," "," `argoexec emissary` is PID 1 wrapping the user command in every container: writes `/var/run/argo/ctr/<name>/exitcode`, waits on ContainerSet dependencies, reads the template from `/var/run/argo/template`. `init`/`wait` (legacy pod layout) or `supervisor` (init-less beta) stage input artifacts before main and run the shared `PostMain` capture sequence after (script result → parameters/artifacts/logs → report outputs). Output capture deliberately uses a background context so termination doesn't lose outputs."," ","-A task's flow is a `Plan` of three phases (Prepare, Run, Collect) over named `Stage`s. Every stage is declared in `workflow/executor/stages.go` (the registry, enforced by a test) and plans are selected per template in `workflow/executor/plan.go`. A `Role` is the part of a task's flow one process runs; roles are declared in `workflow/executor/roles.go` (also a registry), and the `init`, `wait` and `supervisor` commands are each one call to `RunHarness` (`cmd/argoexec/executor/harness.go`) with their role. The `Harness` (`workflow/executor/harness.go`) builds a fresh executor and `ResultSink` (`workflow/executor/sink.go`) per task and owns panic recovery and failure reporting. Main's `emissary` runs outside the harness, through `workflow/executor/maindriver`. New executor behaviour is a new stage, plan or role, not a new hand-written sequence in a command.","+A task's flow is a `Plan` of three phases (Prepare, Run, Collect) over named `Stage`s. Every stage is declared in `workflow/executor/stages.go` (the registry, enforced by a test) and plans are selected per template and `Layout` (legacy pod, init-less pod, worker) in `workflow/executor/plan.go`. A `Role` is the part of a task's flow one process runs; roles are declared in `workflow/executor/roles.go` (also a registry), and the `init`, `wait` and `supervisor` commands are each one call to `RunHarness` (`cmd/argoexec/executor/harness.go`) with their role. The `Harness` (`workflow/executor/harness.go`) builds a fresh executor and `ResultSink` (`workflow/executor/sink.go`) per task and owns panic recovery and failure reporting. In a pod, main's `emissary` runs outside the harness, through `workflow/executor/maindriver`; the test-only `WorkerRole` instead runs a task's whole flow in one process, main included, through the process's `MainDriver`. New executor behaviour is a new stage, plan or role, not a new hand-written sequence in a command."," "," ### Server (`server/`)"," "],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"cmd/argoexec/executor/init.go","lines":["@@ -81,7 +81,6 @@ func InitProcess(ctx context.Context, clientConfig clientcmd.ClientConfig) *exec"," \t\t\tTerminationGracePeriod:       TerminationGracePeriodDuration(),"," \t\t\tArtifactPluginNames:          os.Getenv(common.EnvVarArtifactPluginNames),"," \t\t\tRemoveLocalArtPath:           os.Getenv(\"REMOVE_LOCAL_ART_PATH\") == \"true\",","-\t\t\tInitlessPod:                  common.IsInitlessPod(),"," \t\t\tRetryBackoff:                 retry.ExecutorRetry(ctx),"," \t\t\tResourceStateCheckInterval:   env.LookupEnvDurationOr(ctx, \"RESOURCE_STATE_CHECK_INTERVAL\", 5*time.Second),"," \t\t\tTaskResultRetryTimeout:       retry.ExecutorTaskResultRetryTimeout(ctx),","@@ -139,7 +138,10 @@ func TaskConfigFromEnv(varRunArgo string) executor.TaskConfig {"," func Init(ctx context.Context, clientConfig clientcmd.ClientConfig, varRunArgo string) *executor.WorkflowExecutor {"," \tprocess := InitProcess(ctx, clientConfig)"," \ttask, _, _ := (&PodSource{VarRunArgo: varRunArgo}).Next(ctx) // yields once and never errors","-\treturn process.NewExecutor(task, podSink(process)(task))","+\t// This process only runs the resource or data action. The pod's plan,","+\t// and every read of main's files, is in its wait or supervisor","+\t// container, which takes its own layout, so the layout here is unused.","+\treturn process.NewExecutor(task, executor.LayoutLegacy, podSink(process)(task))"," }"," "," // TerminationGracePeriodDuration returns the terminationGracePeriodSeconds of"],"additions":4,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/tracing.md","lines":["@@ -22,6 +22,39 @@ See [Telemetry Configuration](telemetry-configuration.md#tracing) for setup deta"," "," <!-- Generated documentation BEGIN -->"," ","+### Trace: `RunWorkerTask`","+","+```mermaid","+flowchart TD","+    RunWorkerTask[<a href='#run_worker_task'>run_worker_task</a>]","+    CaptureScriptResult[<a href='#capture_script_result'>capture_script_result</a>]","+    CreateTaskResult[<a href='#create_task_result'>create_task_result</a>]","+    LoadArtifacts[<a href='#load_artifacts'>load_artifacts</a>]","+    PatchTaskResult[<a href='#patch_task_result'>patch_task_result</a>]","+    PatchTaskResultLabels[<a href='#patch_task_result_labels'>patch_task_result_labels</a>]","+    SaveArtifacts[<a href='#save_artifacts'>save_artifacts</a>]","+    SaveLogs[<a href='#save_logs'>save_logs</a>]","+    StageFiles[<a href='#stage_files'>stage_files</a>]","+    LoadArtifact[<a href='#load_artifact'>load_artifact</a>]","+    SaveArtifact[<a href='#save_artifact'>save_artifact</a>]","+    SaveContainerLogs[<a href='#save_container_logs'>save_container_logs</a>]","+    UnarchiveArtifact[<a href='#unarchive_artifact'>unarchive_artifact</a>]","+    ArchiveArtifact[<a href='#archive_artifact'>archive_artifact</a>]","+    RunWorkerTask --> CaptureScriptResult","+    RunWorkerTask --> CreateTaskResult","+    RunWorkerTask --> LoadArtifacts","+    RunWorkerTask --> PatchTaskResult","+    RunWorkerTask --> PatchTaskResultLabels","+    RunWorkerTask --> SaveArtifacts","+    RunWorkerTask --> SaveLogs","+    RunWorkerTask --> StageFiles","+    Lo